WEBVTT

00:11.720 --> 00:14.055
Korea mein zombiyon ka kahar

00:14.264 --> 00:18.268
Hello, main hamesha tumhaara samarthan
karata hoon!

00:18.351 --> 00:20.020
Kya Hyosan mein kuchh hua hai?

00:20.103 --> 00:21.813
Tum Hyosaan kyon ja rahe ho?

00:21.896 --> 00:24.274
Mere dad Hyosan se hain.
kya ye pralay ki shuruaat hai?

00:24.357 --> 00:25.817
Mujhe aaj ka intazaar tha. Zombee?

00:25.900 --> 00:27.527
Aakhirakaar, vo sach mein ja raha hai.

00:27.610 --> 00:30.071
jab tum vahaan pahunchoge to main vaapis
online aaoonga.

00:30.155 --> 00:32.824
Orenge tum par achchha lagata hai.
tum vahaan kyon ja rahe ho?

00:32.907 --> 00:34.242
zombeeland! Traffic ko kya hua?

00:34.325 --> 00:36.578
Ye sab kab se chal raha hai?
Zombeeland kya bala hai?

00:50.133 --> 00:51.259
tumne apani car chhod di?

00:51.342 --> 00:54.471
Aage paidal jaoge?
Tumhaare viewer to badh rahe hain.

00:54.554 --> 00:55.764
Kya tum paagal ho, Orenge?

00:55.847 --> 00:58.183
Mera ek dost vahaan hai, mujhe uski koi
khabar nahine.

00:58.266 --> 01:00.810
Zombeeland mein jaane ke liye tumane
car kahaan paark ke?

01:00.894 --> 01:02.479
Tumhein yahin daphanaaya jayega.

01:02.562 --> 01:04.397
Zombee virus ki mahaamaari phail
gayi hai.

01:04.481 --> 01:06.316
Insta par to asali hi dikhai de raha hai.

01:06.399 --> 01:09.652
Main bhi saath chalana chaahata hoon.
Gloves nahin laaye? Korea mein zombee?

01:09.736 --> 01:12.155
Kal se mainne bahut se helicopter udate
hue dekhe hain.

01:12.238 --> 01:14.783
Tumhara mask kahaan hai?
Kya zombee? Ye to bas ek virus hai.

01:14.866 --> 01:17.202
Tumhein sabse zyaada zaroorat
gardan ke gaurd ki hai.

01:17.285 --> 01:19.287
Agar tum Hyosan ja rahe ho to vaapis mat
aana.

01:19.370 --> 01:20.997
Hamesha apana mask pahan kar rakhana.

01:21.081 --> 01:22.582
Hyosan jaane ke saare raaste band.

01:22.665 --> 01:25.085
Kya kisi zombee ke kaatane se zombee
he ban jaate hain?

01:25.168 --> 01:28.338
Meri maa ne mujhe ghar hi rahane ko
kaha hai aur tum bilakul taiyaar ho.

01:28.421 --> 01:30.381
Tumhaari aatma ko shaanti mile.
Vo kahaan hai?

01:30.465 --> 01:31.633
Kya vaaki vo ek zombee hai?

01:31.716 --> 01:32.884
Kya vo naatak kar raha hai?

01:32.967 --> 01:35.470
tum achchhe kahaanikaar ban sakate
ho. Ye kab khatam hoga?

01:36.679 --> 01:38.598
Ye footage saboot ke taur par istemaal
hogi.

01:39.891 --> 01:43.311
Bahut jaanadaar acting hai tumhaari.
Kya bathroom break milega?

01:43.394 --> 01:45.313
Police kahaan hai?
Apani kulhaadee nikaal lo.

01:45.396 --> 01:47.732
Kuchh dikhaai nahin de raha.
Ye abhi kya dikhaai diya?

01:47.816 --> 01:50.777
Camera rod ki taraf ghumaao. zombee ko
maarane ke liye gun chaahiye.

01:56.116 --> 01:58.034
Mujhe nahin lagata aaj raat main
so paoonga.

01:58.118 --> 01:59.327
Tum vaaki bahut bahaadur ho.

01:59.410 --> 02:02.038
Thoda saaf dikha sakate ho?
Mujhe lagata hai iski to lag gai.

02:02.122 --> 02:04.040
Ye sab dekhate hue mujhe ghutan ho rahi
hai.

02:04.124 --> 02:06.209
Itana bhaagane ke baad uska vazan
kam ho jayega.

02:06.292 --> 02:07.877
Mujhe asali zombee kab dikhaai dega?

02:07.961 --> 02:10.296
Shit, zombeeland! Kya vo bach paayega?
Bhaago vahaan se!

02:10.380 --> 02:12.966
Tumhein ek gun saath rakhani chaahiye
thi. Ye ek zombee hai!

14:57.104 --> 14:58.105
Music 3

24:38.977 --> 24:40.854
Policevaale bekaar hain.
Kya koi zinda hai?

24:40.937 --> 24:43.690
Iske zimmedaar tum khud ho. Tumhaare
bahut se naye fan banenge.

24:43.773 --> 24:45.108
Tum yahaan pahunch kaise gaye?

24:45.192 --> 24:47.444
Isne to hadd hee kar dee hai.
Ye bahut daraavana hai.

24:47.527 --> 24:48.987
Zombee aur kaatil? Koi fark nahin.

24:49.070 --> 24:51.031
Zombee kahaan hain? Tum thake hue lag
rahe ho.

24:51.114 --> 24:53.241
Main tumhaare channel ko subscribe
karoonga. Vaah!

24:53.325 --> 24:54.659
Vahaan se jaldi baahar nikalo.

24:54.743 --> 24:56.953
Khud chal
kar narak mein jaane ki kya zaroorat hai?

24:57.037 --> 24:59.247
Aur zombee nahin hain?
Tumhein maja aa raha hai kya?

24:59.331 --> 25:01.791
Tum jaise logon ki vajah se hi COVID-19
itana phaila hai.

25:01.875 --> 25:03.877
Maa, mujhe bada hokar Orenge jaisa
bananaa hai.

25:03.960 --> 25:05.378
Main tumhaari izzat karata hoon.

25:05.462 --> 25:08.590
Main abhi kaam se vaapis aaya hoon.
abhi bhi chal raha hai? saala paagal!

25:08.673 --> 25:09.966
Tum Orenge King ban gaye ho.

25:10.050 --> 25:12.093
Baahar mat ghumo.
Kya vo virus se sankramit hai?

25:12.177 --> 25:14.804
Toofaan se pahale ki shaanti.
Tumhaari kulhaadi kahaan hai?

25:14.888 --> 25:17.140
Kaate jaane par vo bhi zombee kyon ban
jaate hain?

25:17.224 --> 25:19.184
Tumhaari maa chaahati hai tum ghar par
raho.

25:19.267 --> 25:21.853
Are daravaaza tod do.
Are humein kachara kyon dikha rahe ho?

25:21.937 --> 25:23.480
humein vahaan nahin jaana chaahiye.

25:23.563 --> 25:24.981
Zombee jinda laashein hote hain.

25:33.156 --> 25:34.783
Kya vo bhi zombee ban jaega?

25:34.866 --> 25:36.993
tum kulhaadee apane saath kis lie
laaye ho?

25:37.077 --> 25:39.246
Unki aavaajein bahut daraavanee hoti hain.

25:39.329 --> 25:41.873
Shart laga lo! Ye building zombiyon se
bhari padi hai.

25:41.957 --> 25:44.626
Agar tum meree tarah mahasoos nahin kar
rahe to bhool jao.

25:44.709 --> 25:46.586
Tumhein apane saath gun laani chaahiye
thi.

25:46.670 --> 25:49.339
Sab like aur suscribe karo.
Ise dekh kar narvas ho raha hoon.

25:49.422 --> 25:50.715
Vo paagal hai jo vahaan gaya.

25:50.799 --> 25:53.802
Shaanadaar! Ye zombiyon ka adda hai. jara
dhyaan se. kahaan ja rahe ho?

25:53.885 --> 25:56.972
Ghoomana band karo aur kaheen chhup jao.

25:57.055 --> 26:00.475
Meri hatheliyon par paseena aa raha hai.
Kya tumhaare paas laalaten nahin hai?

26:00.558 --> 26:03.103
Kya humein use bhi zombee banate hue
live dekhana padega?

26:03.186 --> 26:05.438
Vo kaheen se bhi tum par chhalaang laga
sakate hain.

26:05.522 --> 26:07.857
Main to akela kabhi bhi na jaoon.
Ruko aur vaapis aao.

26:07.941 --> 26:09.985
Yakeen kar sakate ho kitane log dekh rahe
hain?

26:10.068 --> 26:11.778
Ye to kisi thriller se bhi badhiya hai.

26:11.861 --> 26:14.030
Jo kuchh bhi tumane kiya hai usake liye
thank you!

26:14.114 --> 26:15.907
Subscribe aur like ki baadh aa rahi hai.

26:15.991 --> 26:18.952
Ye to gaya. Kya pata tha use marate hue
live dekhana padega.

26:19.035 --> 26:21.705
Ye to bachche lag rahe hain.
Ye zombee to bahut hee cute hain.

26:21.788 --> 26:22.789
Ye hai hamaara future!

26:22.872 --> 26:24.958
Zombee bachchon ke liye bahut
dukh ho raha hai.

26:25.041 --> 26:26.167
Mujhe dar lag raha hai.

26:31.423 --> 26:32.966
Aaj raat mujhe nind nahin aayegi.

26:33.049 --> 26:35.427
Aur kitani der karane vaale ho ye sab?
Ise jaari rakho.

26:35.510 --> 26:37.679
Ye bahut hi romaanchak hai.
Kya ho raha hai? Zombee!

26:42.350 --> 26:43.727
Vaise ise dikha kyon rahe ho?

